# Who Blot?


@left


- Southern blotting - created by
  - Edwin Southern - detection of a specific DNA sequence
- Northern blotting - detection of a specific RNA sequence
- Western blotting - detection of a specific protein sequence
- and then it gets crazy


@top-right


![Student-created comparison of stacking and gradient gels.](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/student_stacking-and-gradient-gels.jpg)


@bottom-right


![Student-created sequence for staining, destaining, and visualizing protein bands.](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/student_coomassie-staining.jpg)

=== layout: one-plus-two-panels


# Who Blot?


@left

- Southern: DNA targets; Edwin Southern
- Northern: RNA targets
- Western: protein targets
- Southwestern: DNA-binding proteins
- Eastern: post-translational modifications
- Far-Western: protein-protein interactions

@top-right


![Student-created sequence for staining, destaining, and visualizing protein bands.](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/student_coomassie-staining.jpg)


@bottom-right


![Instructor figure related to protein gels and western blotting](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_003.png)

