# Protein Stability Engineering


@left


- 13. How can one use protein engineering to improve protein stability?
- What amino acids can be changed to improve stability?


@top-right


![Instructor figure related to protein stability engineering](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_077.jpg)


@bottom-right


