=== layout: one-plus-two-panels


# Increase Protein Stability


@left


- Introduction of extra disulfide bonds
- The substrate specificity of an enzyme may be changed by altering amino acids in and around the active site.
- Many proteins are larger than necessary from the industrial viewpoint.
  - Removing extra sequences and simplifying the protein may increase industrial efficiency.


@top-right


![Instructor figure related to protein stability engineering](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_076.jpg)


@bottom-right


![Instructor figure related to protein stability engineering](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_077.jpg)

