@right


![Instructor figure related to protein stability engineering](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_077.jpg)

=== layout: one-plus-two-panels


# Other Ways to Improve Stability


@left

- Reduce entropy of the unfolded state
- Glycine: flexible; often destabilizing
- Proline: rigid; stabilizing in selected turns
- Preserve the native fold and function

@top-right


![Instructor figure related to protein stability engineering](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_076.jpg)


