# Assembly of Zinc Finger Domains


@left


![Instructor figure related to protein domains and dna shuffling](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_081.jpg)


@right

- Zinc-finger motif: about 3 DNA bases recognized
- Three motifs target a 9-bp sequence
- Link DNA-binding array to a nuclease domain
- Amino-acid contacts determine sequence specificity

