# DNA Shuffling


@left

- Fragment related genes
- Reassemble fragments by PCR
- Screen new combinations for improved activity
- Add mutations for variation

@right

![DNA shuffling diagram for protein evolution](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_082.png)

